## 💬 Example Queries

### Shipping

```text
User: When will my order arrive?

Bot: 🚚 Shipping: Standard 3-5 days; express 1-2 days.
Share your order number for tracking.
```

### Product Information

```text
User: Tell me about the laptop.

Bot: The laptop has a 15.6 inch display,
512GB SSD, and 16GB RAM.
```

### Pricing

```text
User: How much does the laptop cost?

Bot: The laptop costs $999.
```

### Sentiment

```text
User: The product is terrible.

Sentiment: Negative
```

### Human Agent

```text
User: I want to speak to a human.

Bot: Sure. I can help connect you with a human
customer-support representative.
```

